description:
Susun output harga awal, informasi potongan, dan harga akhir. Potongan berlaku jika harga setidaknya 50000.

```java
public class TraceDiscountBranch {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int price = 60000;
        System.out.println("Before: " + price);
        if (price >= 50000) {
            price -= 10000;
            System.out.println("Discount: 10000");
        }
        System.out.println("After: " + price);
    }
}
```
